","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"title":"⑦ 参考图片7｜官方 LoadImage","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadImage","cnr_id":"comfy-core"},"widgets_values":["","image"]},{"id":9028,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[-938.3799462357305,2160.0625074563222],"size":[300,230],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择文件上传","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"title":"⑧ 参考图片8｜官方 LoadImage","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadImage","cnr_id":"comfy-core"},"widgets_values":["","image"]},{"id":9020,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1995.8595524785585,1572.2260049275546],"size":[650,300],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"R2V 开关说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 最后一步怎么连线\n\n### ① 参考图片\n| 素材 | 从哪里 | 接到 H3 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 图片1 | `参考图片1｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_0` |\n| 图片2 | `参考图片2｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_1` |\n| 图片3 | `参考图片3｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_2` |\n| 图片4 | `参考图片4｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_3` |\n| 图片5 | `参考图片5｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_4` |\n| 图片6 | `参考图片6｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_5` |\n| 图片7 | `参考图片7｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_6` |\n| 图片8 | `参考图片8｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_7` |\n| 图片9 | `参考图片9｜LoadImage` 的 **IMAGE** | `ref_image_8` |\n\n### ② 参考视频\n**视频1：**\n`参考视频1｜LoadVideo` → `视频1｜GetVideoComponents` 已经连好。\n最后一步：\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **images** → H3 `ref_video_0`\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **audio** → H3 `ref_video_audio_0`（只有你要使用视频原音时才接）\n\n**视频2：**\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **images** → H3 `ref_video_1`\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **audio** → H3 `ref_video_audio_1`\n\n**视频3：**\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **images** → H3 `ref_video_2`\n- `GetVideoComponents` 的 **audio** → H3 `ref_video_audio_2`\n\n### ③ 独立参考音频\n- `参考音频1｜官方 LoadAudio` 的 **AUDIO** → H3 `ref_audio_0`\n- `参考音频2｜官方 LoadAudio` 的 **AUDIO** → H3 `ref_audio_1`\n- `参考音频3｜官方 LoadAudio` 的 **AUDIO** → H3 `ref_audio_2`\n\n### 最简单的例子\n如果这次只想用 **图片1 + 图片2**：\n- 图片1 IMAGE → `ref_image_0`\n- 图片2 IMAGE → `ref_image_1`\n- 其他全部不要连。\n\n如果只想用 **首图 + 尾图**：\n- 首图 → `ref_image_0`\n- 尾图 → `ref_image_1`\n\n**不用的输入保持断开即可。**\n\n### 接线位置\n所有要接的线，终点都是同一个官方节点：\n**`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`**\n\n找到它左侧的：\n`ref_image_0～8`\n`ref_video_0～2`\n`ref_video_audio_0～2`\n`ref_audio_0～2`\n\n从素材节点右侧输出端拖过去即可。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":9001,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1997.1876658133165,1929.7026807426182],"size":[650,300],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## MiniMax H3 R2V｜官方原版 + 扩展输入｜只差最后一步\n\n**原则：全部使用 ComfyUI 官方节点。**\n模型、VAE、CLIP、采样器、视频/音频解码与输出链保持官方结构。\n\n本工作流已经把“官方节点之间能预先连接的线”全部连接好。\n**唯一故意不连接的是：素材节点 → MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo 的最后一根线。**\n\n你只需要：\n1. 上传本次要用的图片 / 视频 / 音频；\n2. 按下面的说明，把对应输出端拖到 H3 节点对应输入端；\n3. 不使用的素材不要连接；\n4. 直接运行。\n\n这样不会再有自定义开关节点，也不会改变官方 H3 的输入逻辑。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":9039,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1868.9295183224694,2286.6357717272854],"size":[520,300],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"R2V 输入说明（官方原生节点版）","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 音频安全修复\n\n独立音频节点已改为安全可选加载：OFF 时直接输出 None，不访问文件路径；ON 时才读取你选择的音频。\n这样未使用的音频输入不会阻塞整个 H3 R2V 工作流。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":9,"type":"ResolutionSelector","pos":[-866.9107809782394,482.99690059301497],"size":[300,170],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"宽高比","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"百万像素","name":"megapixels","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"megapixels"